      "reply": "She has two main Medicare paths to compare: Original Medicare, which is Part A and Part B through the federal program, or a Medicare Advantage plan, which is offered by a private company and provides Part A and Part B. With Original Medicare, she can usually add a separate drug plan and may be able to buy Medigap; with Medicare Advantage, drug coverage is often included.",
